{"headword":"חִזְקִיָּ֫הוּ","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>hath strengthened</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>strengtheneth;</em> = Assyrian <em>Ḫazaḳi(i)au</em>, Schr<sup> COT</sup> on <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.1\">2 K 18:1 ff.</a>, Jäger<sup> BAS i, 469</sup>; cf. n.pr. <span dir=\"rtl\">יחזק</span> on seal Gann<sup> JAs 1883 Feb.–Mar., 134 No. 7</sup>;—on format. v. Lag<sup>BN 134</sup><strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"𝔊 Εζεκιας, <em>son of Ahaz</em>, King of Judah, seldom †<span dir=\"rtl\">חִזְקִיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.1\">2 K 18:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.14\">14</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.16\">16</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, also <span dir=\"rtl\">אַנְשֵׁי ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.1\">Pr 25:1</a> †; elsewhere in 2 K (except <a data-ref=\"II Kings 20:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.20.10\">20:10</a>) <span dir=\"rtl\">חִזְקִיָּהוּ</span>: <a data-ref=\"II Kings 16:20\" href=\"/II_Kings.16.20\">16:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.9\">18:9</a> + 34 times, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18-21\" href=\"/II_Kings.18-21\">2 K 18–21</a> ‖ <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.1\">Is 36:1</a> + 31 times, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36-39\" href=\"/Isaiah.36-39\">Is 36–39</a>; also †<a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 26:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.26.18\">Je 26:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 26:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.26.19\">19</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.13\">1 Ch 3:13</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.18\">2 Ch 29:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:27\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.27\">27</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chro